      "interaction": {
        "type": "guide",
        "distance": 2.5,
        "autoTrigger": true,
        "hintText": "🧨 年初一",
        "dialogues": [
          {
            "id": "greeting",
            "text": "新年到，福气到！祝你新年像爆竹一样——响亮亮，亮堂堂！",
            "audio": "https://mogs-1300354879.cos.ap-shanghai.myqcloud.com/mogs/timi-activity/gs-viewer/models/showcase/proj_chinese_garden/assets/NPC-1/0-N.wav",
            "responses": [
              {
                "id": "resp_a",
                "text": "祝你新年红红火火！",
                "audio": "https://mogs-1300354879.cos.ap-shanghai.myqcloud.com/mogs/timi-activity/gs-viewer/models/showcase/proj_chinese_garden/assets/NPC-1/0-U-A.wav"
              },
              {
                "id": "resp_b",
                "text": "祝你岁岁平安喜乐！",
                "audio": "https://mogs-1300354879.cos.ap-shanghai.myqcloud.com/mogs/timi-activity/gs-viewer/models/showcase/proj_chinese_garden/assets/NPC-1/0-U-B.wav"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "resp_a",
            "text": "红红火火好！就像我身上的颜色一样～你说，为什么大家要争着放新年的第一串爆竹呀？",
            "audio": "https://mogs-1300354879.cos.ap-shanghai.myqcloud.com/mogs/timi-activity/gs-viewer/models/showcase/proj_chinese_garden/assets/NPC-1/1-N-A.wav",
            "responses": [
              {
                "id": "round2_a",
                "text": "因为声音越响，福气来得越快！",
                "audio": "https://mogs-1300354879.cos.ap-shanghai.myqcloud.com/mogs/timi-activity/gs-viewer/models/showcase/proj_chinese_garden/assets/NPC-1/1-U-A.wav"
              },
              {
                "id": "round2_b",
                "text": "因为谁家放得早谁就能最早吃饭。",
                "audio": "https://mogs-1300354879.cos.ap-shanghai.myqcloud.com/mogs/timi-activity/gs-viewer/models/showcase/proj_chinese_garden/assets/NPC-1/1-U-B.wav"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "resp_b",
            "text": "平安喜乐里可有我的功劳呢！老话说，爆竹能驱邪保平安。你说，为什么大家要争着放新年的第一串爆竹呀？",
            "audio": "https://mogs-1300354879.cos.ap-shanghai.myqcloud.com/mogs/timi-activity/gs-viewer/models/showcase/proj_chinese_garden/assets/NPC-1/1-N-B.wav",
            "responses": [
              {
                "id": "round2_a",
                "text": "因为声音越响，福气来得越快！",
                "audio": "https://mogs-1300354879.cos.ap-shanghai.myqcloud.com/mogs/timi-activity/gs-viewer/models/showcase/proj_chinese_garden/assets/NPC-1/1-U-A.wav"
              },
              {
                "id": "round2_b",
                "text": "因为谁家放得早谁就能最早吃饭。",
                "audio": "https://mogs-1300354879.cos.ap-shanghai.myqcloud.com/mogs/timi-activity/gs-viewer/models/showcase/proj_chinese_garden/assets/NPC-1/1-U-B.wav"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "round2_a",
            "text": "对对对！这叫'开门迎福'。那我再问问，现在很多人用电子鞭炮，这是为什么呢？",
            "audio": "https://mogs-1300354879.cos.ap-shanghai.myqcloud.com/mogs/timi-activity/gs-viewer/models/showcase/proj_chinese_garden/assets/NPC-1/2-N-A.wav",
            "responses": [
              {
                "id": "round3_a",
                "text": "因为更安全，不会伤到人。",
                "audio": "https://mogs-1300354879.cos.ap-shanghai.myqcloud.com/mogs/timi-activity/gs-viewer/models/showcase/proj_chinese_garden/assets/NPC-1/2-U-A.wav"
              },
              {
                "id": "round3_b",
                "text": "因为电子鞭炮的声音更响亮。",
                "audio": "https://mogs-1300354879.cos.ap-shanghai.myqcloud.com/mogs/timi-activity/gs-viewer/models/showcase/proj_chinese_garden/assets/NPC-1/2-U-B.wav"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "round2_b",
            "text": "不对哦，和吃饭没关系～其实是因为声音越响，福气来得越快！那我再问问，现在很多人用电子鞭炮，这是为什么呢？",
            "audio": "https://mogs-1300354879.cos.ap-shanghai.myqcloud.com/mogs/timi-activity/gs-viewer/models/showcase/proj_chinese_garden/assets/NPC-1/2-N-B.wav",
            "responses": [
              {
                "id": "round3_a",
                "text": "因为更安全，不会伤到人。",
                "audio": "https://mogs-1300354879.cos.ap-shanghai.myqcloud.com/mogs/timi-activity/gs-viewer/models/showcase/proj_chinese_garden/assets/NPC-1/2-U-A.wav"
              },
              {
                "id": "round3_b",
                "text": "因为电子鞭炮的声音更响亮。",
                "audio": "https://mogs-1300354879.cos.ap-shanghai.myqcloud.com/mogs/timi-activity/gs-viewer/models/showcase/proj_chinese_garden/assets/NPC-1/2-U-B.wav"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "round3_a",
            "text": "安全最重要！电子鞭炮又漂亮又不怕火星。最后一个问题：年初一除了放爆竹，还有一件特别重要的事是什么？",
            "audio": "https://mogs-1300354879.cos.ap-shanghai.myqcloud.com/mogs/timi-activity/gs-viewer/models/showcase/proj_chinese_garden/assets/NPC-1/3-N-A.wav",
            "responses": [
              {
                "id": "final_a",
                "text": "要给长辈拜年，说吉祥话！",
                "audio": "https://mogs-1300354879.cos.ap-shanghai.myqcloud.com/mogs/timi-activity/gs-viewer/models/showcase/proj_chinese_garden/assets/NPC-1/3-U-A.wav"
              },
              {
                "id": "final_b",
                "text": "要整天睡觉，不能出门。",
                "audio": "https://mogs-1300354879.cos.ap-shanghai.myqcloud.com/mogs/timi-activity/gs-viewer/models/showcase/proj_chinese_garden/assets/NPC-1/3-U-B.wav"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "round3_b",
            "text": "不对哦，电子鞭炮的声音其实没那么响，主要是安全环保。最后一个问题：年初一除了放爆竹，还有一件特别重要的事是什么？",
            "audio": "https://mogs-1300354879.cos.ap-shanghai.myqcloud.com/mogs/timi-activity/gs-viewer/models/showcase/proj_chinese_garden/assets/NPC-1/3-N-B.wav",
            "responses": [
              {
                "id": "final_a",
                "text": "要给长辈拜年，说吉祥话！",
                "audio": "https://mogs-1300354879.cos.ap-shanghai.myqcloud.com/mogs/timi-activity/gs-viewer/models/showcase/proj_chinese_garden/assets/NPC-1/3-U-A.wav"
              },
              {
                "id": "final_b",
                "text": "要整天睡觉，不能出门。",
                "audio": "https://mogs-1300354879.cos.ap-shanghai.myqcloud.com/mogs/timi-activity/gs-viewer/models/showcase/proj_chinese_garden/assets/NPC-1/3-U-B.wav"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "final_a",
            "text": "真懂事！拜年是表达对长辈的尊敬和爱，吉祥话能给全家带来好心情～记住啦，开个好头，一年都有精神！",
            "audio": "https://mogs-1300354879.cos.ap-shanghai.myqcloud.com/mogs/timi-activity/gs-viewer/models/showcase/proj_chinese_garden/assets/NPC-1/4-N-A.wav",
            "responses": []
          },
          {
            "id": "final_b",
            "text": "不对哦，年初一要出门拜年，整天睡觉可不好～记住啦，开个好头，一年都有精神！",
            "audio": "https://mogs-1300354879.cos.ap-shanghai.myqcloud.com/mogs/timi-activity/gs-viewer/models/showcase/proj_chinese_garden/assets/NPC-1/4-N-B.wav",
