      "movementPattern": "idle",
      "interaction": {
        "type": "guide",
        "distance": 2.5,
        "autoTrigger": true,
        "hintText": "🎁 年初二",
        "dialogues": [
          {
            "id": "greeting",
            "text": "新年安康！祝你今年像蜜糖糕一样，日子甜，心里暖！",
            "audio": "https://mogs-1300354879.cos.ap-shanghai.myqcloud.com/mogs/timi-activity/gs-viewer/models/showcase/proj_chinese_garden/assets/NPC-2/0-N.wav",
            "responses": [
              {
                "id": "resp_a",
                "text": "祝你全家团圆美满！",
                "audio": "https://mogs-1300354879.cos.ap-shanghai.myqcloud.com/mogs/timi-activity/gs-viewer/models/showcase/proj_chinese_garden/assets/NPC-2/0-U-A.wav"
              },
              {
                "id": "resp_b",
                "text": "祝你笑容永远甜甜！",
                "audio": "https://mogs-1300354879.cos.ap-shanghai.myqcloud.com/mogs/timi-activity/gs-viewer/models/showcase/proj_chinese_garden/assets/NPC-2/0-U-B.wav"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "resp_a",
            "text": "团圆最美了！你知道年初二为什么又叫'迎婿日'吗？",
            "audio": "https://mogs-1300354879.cos.ap-shanghai.myqcloud.com/mogs/timi-activity/gs-viewer/models/showcase/proj_chinese_garden/assets/NPC-2/1-N-A.wav",
            "responses": [
              {
                "id": "round2_a",
                "text": "因为女婿这天要陪女儿回娘家！",
                "audio": "https://mogs-1300354879.cos.ap-shanghai.myqcloud.com/mogs/timi-activity/gs-viewer/models/showcase/proj_chinese_garden/assets/NPC-2/1-U-A.wav"
              },
              {
                "id": "round2_b",
                "text": "因为这天要迎接财神进门。",
                "audio": "https://mogs-1300354879.cos.ap-shanghai.myqcloud.com/mogs/timi-activity/gs-viewer/models/showcase/proj_chinese_garden/assets/NPC-2/1-U-B.wav"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "resp_b",
            "text": "我的笑呀，是因为想到要见家人啦！你知道年初二为什么又叫'迎婿日'吗？",
            "audio": "https://mogs-1300354879.cos.ap-shanghai.myqcloud.com/mogs/timi-activity/gs-viewer/models/showcase/proj_chinese_garden/assets/NPC-2/1-N-B.wav",
            "responses": [
              {
                "id": "round2_a",
                "text": "因为女婿这天要陪女儿回娘家！",
                "audio": "https://mogs-1300354879.cos.ap-shanghai.myqcloud.com/mogs/timi-activity/gs-viewer/models/showcase/proj_chinese_garden/assets/NPC-2/1-U-A.wav"
              },
              {
                "id": "round2_b",
                "text": "因为这天要迎接财神进门。",
                "audio": "https://mogs-1300354879.cos.ap-shanghai.myqcloud.com/mogs/timi-activity/gs-viewer/models/showcase/proj_chinese_garden/assets/NPC-2/1-U-B.wav"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "round2_a",
            "text": "对啦，女儿女婿回门的日子。那我问问，回娘家带的礼物为什么要成双成对呢？",
            "audio": "https://mogs-1300354879.cos.ap-shanghai.myqcloud.com/mogs/timi-activity/gs-viewer/models/showcase/proj_chinese_garden/assets/NPC-2/2-N-A.wav",
            "responses": [
              {
                "id": "round3_a",
                "text": "因为双数代表好事成双！",
                "audio": "https://mogs-1300354879.cos.ap-shanghai.myqcloud.com/mogs/timi-activity/gs-viewer/models/showcase/proj_chinese_garden/assets/NPC-2/2-U-A.wav"
              },
              {
                "id": "round3_b",
                "text": "因为单数不够分。",
                "audio": "https://mogs-1300354879.cos.ap-shanghai.myqcloud.com/mogs/timi-activity/gs-viewer/models/showcase/proj_chinese_garden/assets/NPC-2/2-U-B.wav"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "round2_b",
            "text": "不对哦，迎财神是初五～其实是女儿女婿回门的日子。那我问问，回娘家带的礼物为什么要成双成对呢？",
            "audio": "https://mogs-1300354879.cos.ap-shanghai.myqcloud.com/mogs/timi-activity/gs-viewer/models/showcase/proj_chinese_garden/assets/NPC-2/2-N-B.wav",
            "responses": [
              {
                "id": "round3_a",
                "text": "因为双数代表好事成双！",
                "audio": "https://mogs-1300354879.cos.ap-shanghai.myqcloud.com/mogs/timi-activity/gs-viewer/models/showcase/proj_chinese_garden/assets/NPC-2/2-U-A.wav"
              },
              {
                "id": "round3_b",
                "text": "因为单数不够分。",
                "audio": "https://mogs-1300354879.cos.ap-shanghai.myqcloud.com/mogs/timi-activity/gs-viewer/models/showcase/proj_chinese_garden/assets/NPC-2/2-U-B.wav"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "round3_a",
            "text": "是呀，成双成对才吉祥。再考考你：年初二还有什么特别的活动？",
            "audio": "https://mogs-1300354879.cos.ap-shanghai.myqcloud.com/mogs/timi-activity/gs-viewer/models/showcase/proj_chinese_garden/assets/NPC-2/3-N-A.wav",
            "responses": [
              {
                "id": "final_a",
                "text": "祭财神，希望新年财源广进！",
                "audio": "https://mogs-1300354879.cos.ap-shanghai.myqcloud.com/mogs/timi-activity/gs-viewer/models/showcase/proj_chinese_garden/assets/NPC-2/3-U-A.wav"
              },
              {
                "id": "final_b",
                "text": "整天不扫地，怕扫走财运。",
                "audio": "https://mogs-1300354879.cos.ap-shanghai.myqcloud.com/mogs/timi-activity/gs-viewer/models/showcase/proj_chinese_garden/assets/NPC-2/3-U-B.wav"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "round3_b",
